cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "SCRIBE — Spec-Conditioned ReAct with Inline Backreview Escalation"
message: "If you use this software, please cite the accompanying paper."
authors:
  - family-names: "TBD"
    given-names: "TBD"
abstract: >
  SCRIBE is a three-role agent architecture (Spec Agent, ReAct Executor,
  Review Agent) with asymmetric model assignment (frontier model for
  spec/review, smaller open-weights model for the heavy executor), evaluated
  on the DABStep data-analysis benchmark.
keywords:
  - large language models
  - agent architecture
  - data analysis
  - DABStep
  - role specialization
